OL,3,GNEWSAVisitors from France more than
OL,4,Adouble since 2023
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of visitors to Guernsey from
OL,7,FFrance has more than doubled since
OL,8,F2023, according to the latest figures.
OL,10,FData from the States of Guernsey shows
OL,11,Fthe number of people visiting the
OL,12,Fisland from France between July, August
OL,13,Fand September in 2026 was up by 103%,
OL,14,Fcompared with the same period three
OL,15,Fyears ago.
OL,17,FThe Guernsey Quarterly Travel and
OL,18,FVisitor Accommodation Bulletin found
OL,19,Fthe figure was up by 21% on this time
OL,20,Flast year, while visitors from the UK
OL,21,Fhad also increased by 5% compared with
OL,22,Fthe same period in 2025.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
