OL,3,GNEWSAVisitors from France more than
OL,4,Adouble since 2023
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Lee van Katwyk, tourism lead for
OL,7,Fthe committee for economic development,
OL,8,Fsaid the rise in visitors numbers was
OL,9,F"really encouraging".
